 viewed freely</strong>. Most are in high definition.<br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>The controls are simple and may be suitable for casual players.<br></li><li>More than 200 paintings by real artists such as Degas, Rubens, van Gogh, Monet...<br></li><li>Discover works of art in an original way!</li></ul>","developers":["M.R. Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1225040/49e6e02114421db0b1e68f813db605bc8f69ce07/header.jpg?t=1772633365","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1225040/329202/887dd140b28d6c7e11135b39e32ebe1702c5974a/1751206522/dash_av1.mpd?t=1617790303","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1225040/329202/887dd140b28d6c7e11135b39e32ebe1702c5974a/1751206522/dash_h264.mpd?t=1617790303","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1225040/329202/887dd140b28d6c7e11135b39e32ebe1702c5974a/1751206522/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1617790303","id":256811016,"name":"Trailer_EN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256811016/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1617790303"}],"name":"A Mysterious Gallery","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"A Mysterious Gallery - $6.99 USD","packageid":424560,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_